{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06096","headline":"田家 · 王维","name":"田家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧谷行将尽，良苗未可希。\n老年方爱粥，卒岁且无衣。\n雀乳青苔井，鸡鸣白板扉。\n柴车驾羸牸，草屩牧豪狶。\n夕雨红榴拆，新秋绿芋肥。\n饷田桑下憩，旁舍草中归。\n住处名愚谷，何烦问是非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}